ont'])?>" required><small class="muted">Used for artist names, mixes, BPM and supporting metadata.</small></label><label class="wide">Labels / kicker font stack<input name="label_font" value="<?=e($theme['label_font'])?>" required><small class="muted">Used for labels such as Featured track and Fresh music.</small></label><label class="wide">Button font stack<input name="button_font" value="<?=e($theme['button_font'])?>" required><small class="muted">Used for buttons and action controls.</small></label><label class="wide">Default artwork URL or site-relative path<input name="default_artwork" value="<?=e($theme['default_artwork'])?>" placeholder="/assets/images/brand-orb.svg"><small class="muted">Used when a page or email needs fallback artwork.</small></label><input type="hidden" name="action" value="theme_save"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?=e(csrf_token())?>"><button class="button wide">Save theme</button></form><?php endif;?>
